C.SEC.agent-redteam\",\"CI logs, fuzz reproducers, crash annotations and telemetry are not registered as agent inputs; existing redteam entries do not cover triage. Real injection path into baseline/quarantine changes.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-15\",True,True,True,\"contracts.json C-TEST evidence_bundle\",\"Bundle lacks holdout, test-integrity diff, baseline change log, double conformance, flake events, provenance; critics need them for the integrity checks. Minor severity is right.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-16\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json ARCH.ORG.critic-calibration, QA.AGENT.gate-canaries, ARCH.ORG.human-gates\",\"Text says below-threshold critics 'stop counting as gates' with no replacement or blocking rule, so gates fail open. Fail-closed with human interim sign-off is sound.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-17\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json QA.AGENT.*; radar.json 'Validation of autonomous-agent development'; docs/06 A13; check.py radar rules\",\"holdout and oracle-change-control are E though A13 admits little evidence, and radar lists only 4 of 7 QA.AGENT caps. Re-marking to M plus radar addition satisfies check.py rules.\"),\n]\njson.dump([dict(id=a,fact_holds=b,material=c,severity_ok=d,checked=e,reason=f) for a,b,c,d,e,f in r],open('verify_out_K-TEST.json','w'),indent=1)\nE"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":63092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1161,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013wkfMVfp9EBM5xkU6fxH7d":{"command":"cd /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad; python3 - <<'E'\nimport json\nr=[\n(\"K-TEST-9\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json QA.ROBUST.*, QA.SIM.netsim, contracts.json C-SHARD/C-SRVDATA, milestones.json M6\",\"No capability owns distributed fault/consistency validation; netsim is single-process and M6 exit demands crash-consistency with no producing capability. Test-double part is weak (C-SHARD/C-SRVDATA are not boundary contracts) but the core omission stands.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-10\",True,True,True,\"contracts.json C-TEST evidence_bundle; untrusted-inputs.json; QA.ROBUST.fuzzing\",\"Evidence is literally 'fuzz hours' with no coverage/reachability criterion; a shallow harness satisfies it. Change is sound.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-11\",True,True,True,\"untrusted-inputs.json saves; docs/09\",\"saves is trusted-local with limits size/depth only, while assets and mods are hostile-local; user-editable/shared saves are a real attack surface. Fix is cheap and sound.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-12\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json BLD.REL.staged-rollout, QA.STRAT.release-criteria\",\"Capability named staged but text mandates simultaneous global rollout, removing the canary gate; contradicts the name and release-criteria oracle. Reword is sound.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-13\",True,True,False,\"capabilities.json QA.RENDER.*, UI.FW.validation, skills.json render-validation\",\"No final-present/HDR/text capture exists in QA.RENDER, but UI.FW.validation already covers UI screenshot regression, so 'misses UI' is overstated; residual gap is swapchain/HDR/2D composition, closer to minor.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-14\",True,True,True,\"untrusted-inputs.json redteam entries; XC.SEC.agent-redteam\",\"CI logs, fuzz reproducers, crash annotations and telemetry are not registered as agent inputs; existing redteam entries do not cover triage. Real injection path into baseline/quarantine changes.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-15\",True,True,True,\"contracts.json C-TEST evidence_bundle\",\"Bundle lacks holdout, test-integrity diff, baseline change log, double conformance, flake events, provenance; critics need them for the integrity checks. Minor severity is right.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-16\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json ARCH.ORG.critic-calibration, QA.AGENT.gate-canaries, ARCH.ORG.human-gates\",\"Text says below-threshold critics 'stop counting as gates' with no replacement or blocking rule, so gates fail open. Fail-closed with human interim sign-off is sound.\"),\n(\"K-TEST-17\",True,True,True,\"capabilities.json QA.AGENT.*; radar.json 'Validation of autonomous-agent development'; docs/06 A13; check.py radar rules\",\"holdout and oracle-change-control are E though A13 admits little evidence, and radar lists only 4 of 7 QA.AGENT caps. Re-marking to M plus radar addition satisfies check.py rules.\"),\n]\njson.dump([dict(id=a,fact_holds=b,material=c,severity_ok=d,checked=e,reason=f) for a,b,c,d,e,f in r],open('verify_out_K-TEST.json','w'),indent=1)\nE"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfZDecPuHNjcJMMVfpzsr","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ae64490d-eb29-42e1-9e47-f6bedd351a24","timestamp":"2026-09-30T07:20:28.165Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
